<title>USA: US Diagnostic says acquisition accretive.</title>
<headline>US Diagnostic says acquisition accretive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Diagnostic Inc said on Friday it had completed its acquisition of five multi-modality outpatient diagnostic imaging facilities in the Dayton, Ohio market for cash, and that the deal is accretive to earnings.</p>
<p>The company added that it will continue with its efforts to structure its acquisitions using its cash resources in order to control further dilution of its stock as well as make purchases that are accretive to earnings.</p>
</text>
